      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see. You wanted to use -1 as a special value for template_matched.\n\nIt looks like there are a lot more significant implicit type conversions in this file + I don\u0027t think we will ever turn on strict type conversion checking in EC, so I guess this is fine.\n\nTo add a bit of context, \"const\"s are great because they can be scoped and because they have a proper type that can be checked. This struck me as slightly odd because we immediately break the const\u0027s type.",
