      "writtenOn": "2019-10-17T01:11:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mismatch is really because we were not careful enough historically (e.g. in ec_command.h the max index is 16 bits, in biod we have some 32-bits), and we should try to fix it up. We only need 8 bits. For now I changed this local const to be int8_t to avoid a cast since we fully control this local const and won\u0027t assign -1 to it. I will prepare another CL to change the argument of fp_enable_positive_match_secret to be int8_t.",
